ern’s contemporary art space, located on the first floor of Curry Student Center.","source_url":"https://camd.northeastern.edu/center-for-the-arts/gallery-360/","source_title":"Gallery 360","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The official page lists Monday–Saturday hours of noon–5 p.m.; exhibitions and access may change.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"northeastern-snell-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Snell Library","title":"5. Make Snell Library your reference point","subtitle":"376 Huntington Avenue • Boston campus","notes":"Walk through the library to identify its study areas and support services. If you need a group space later, use the library’s reservation process during service hours.","short_summary":"The Boston campus library and a practical academic anchor.","evidence_claim":"Northeastern identifies Snell Library at 376 Huntington Avenue and notes that student study rooms can be reserved during service desk hours.","source_url":"https://library.northeastern.edu/ideas/about-snell-library/","source_title":"About Snell Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Check current library hours before visiting; student room reservations are limited to service hours.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"northeastern-library-quad","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Library Quad","title":"6. Cross Library Quad","subtitle":"Between Snell and central campus • outdoor connector","notes":"Use this named quad as your outdoor connector from Snell toward the rest of campus. Pause to locate the surrounding buildings rather than treating it as a shortcut.","short_summary":"A named campus quad shown on Northeastern’s visitor map.","evidence_cla